#!/bin/sh
#PBS -N iter1_mnist_ffnn_adam
#PBS -q gpu_1
#PBS -P CSCI1166
#PBS -l select=1:ncpus=4:mem=32gb:ngpus=1
#PBS -l walltime=04:00:00
#PBS -o /mnt/lustre/users/aschreuder/CHPC-Autoresearch/logs/iter1_mnist_ffnn_adam.out
#PBS -e /mnt/lustre/users/aschreuder/CHPC-Autoresearch/logs/iter1_mnist_ffnn_adam.err
#PBS -m abe -M arneschreuder@icloud.com

set -euo pipefail

module purge
module load chpc/python/anaconda/3-2024.10.1

cd /mnt/lustre/users/aschreuder/CHPC-Autoresearch
source .venv/bin/activate
pip install -e . --quiet

echo "=========================================="
echo "Job: iter1_mnist_ffnn_adam"
echo "=========================================="
echo "Start time: $(date)"
echo ""

python -m autoresearch.train --multirun experiment=mnist_ffnn_adam

echo ""
echo "=========================================="
echo "JOB COMPLETED"
echo "=========================================="
echo "End time: $(date)"
